WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.410
- Well, it seems like just
after I release a video

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:04.873
on the controversy of
the Nike versus MSCHF,

00:00:04.873 --> 00:00:08.040
the Satan shoes trademark case, well,

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.900
the parties just up and settled,

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.660
so this case is really no more.

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:12.730
As part of the settlement,

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:13.910
at least the part that's public,

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:16.420
Nike says that MSCHF will recall the shoes

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:18.070
and offer a full reimbursement

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:20.680
to anyone that purchased the
shoes and wants a refund.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:21.870
But other than that, it doesn't seem

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:24.390
that the parties agreed
to any other terms.

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:26.660
So it doesn't seem like MSCHF
is going to have to pay Nike

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.160
anything, which of course
is a great result for MSCHF

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:31.470
because they got tons
and tons of publicity

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:34.310
which is of course what they
wanted in the first place.

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:35.810
So it doesn't look like
we'll see Nike or MSCHF

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:38.460
in the same court again,
but I will see you in court.

